# Exam track — Theme: Film & TV — Sub-lesson 3: Talking About It
# @question sentences: the examiner asks in Luxembourgish, the learner
# assembles the Luxembourgish answer (always en→lu).
#
# These are the user's real answers, gathered by interview on 2026-09-01 —
# do not "improve" or genericize them in a later editing pass. The point is
# that the learner rehearses what they will actually say in the Sproochentest.
#
# The @fill blocks carry frames that recur across any topic: well-causal,
# wann-conditional, obwuel-contrast, léiwer-wéi comparative, fir…ze purpose,
# dofir inversion, a number blank, a frequency adverb, and an Ech-mengen hedge.

@lesson T1.03 "Talking About Film & TV"

@word kucken = to watch
@word streamen = to stream
@word léinen = to borrow
@word eraussichen = to pick out
@word sech entspanen = to relax
@word abonéieren = to subscribe
@word oplueden = to upload
@word wiesselen = to switch
@word wielen = to choose
@word de Superheld = the superhero
@word d'Handlung = the plot
@word d'Sendung = the broadcast
@word de Programm = the program
@word d'Paus = the break
@word de Virdeel = the advantage
@word d'Gesellschaft = the company
@word d'Schlofzëmmer = the bedroom
@word de Kapp = the head
@word bequeem = convenient
@word deier = expensive

@sentence
@question Kuckt Dir gär Filmer? Firwat?
@lu Jo, ech kucke gär Filmer, well ech dat entspanend fannen an et mir hëlleft, de Kapp fräi ze maachen.
@en Yes, I like watching movies, because I find that relaxing and it helps me clear my mind.
@distractor-lu langweileg
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en boring
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@question Wat fir e Film hutt Dir fir d'lescht gesinn, a wéi war en?
@lu Fir d'lescht hunn ech en Actionfilm iwwer eng Grupp vu Superhelde gesinn, an e war spannend.
@en Last I saw an action movie about a group of superheroes, and it was exciting.
@distractor-lu Comedie
@distractor-lu langweileg
@distractor-en comedy
@distractor-en boring

@sentence
@question Gitt Dir gär an de Kino? Wéi dacks?
@lu Jo, ech gi gär an de Kino, mee nëmmen eemol de Mount, well et e bëssen deier ass.
@en Yes, I like going to the cinema, but only once a month, because it is a bit expensive.
@distractor-lu Woch
@distractor-lu Internet
@distractor-en week
@distractor-en internet

@sentence
@question Wat fir eng Zort Filmer hutt Dir am léifsten?
@lu Ech hu Science-Fiction Filmer am léifsten, well se vill Fantasie weisen a spannend sinn.
@en I like science fiction movies the most, because they show a lot of imagination and are exciting.
@distractor-lu Comedien
@distractor-lu fad
@distractor-en comedies
@distractor-en dull

@sentence
@question Wat ass dee schlechste Film, deen Dir je gesinn hutt?
@lu De schlechste Film war eng Comedie, déi ech guer net witzeg fonnt hunn.
@en The worst movie was a comedy that I did not find funny at all.
@distractor-lu spannend
@distractor-lu Thriller
@distractor-en exciting
@distractor-en thriller

@sentence
@question Wat ass Äre Liblingsfilm?
@lu Mäi Liblingsfilm ass Inception, well e ganz intelligent an interessant ass.
@en My favorite movie is Inception, because it is very intelligent and interesting.
@distractor-lu langweileg
@distractor-lu Serie
@distractor-en boring
@distractor-en series

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir e Liblingsschauspiller?
@lu Jo, mäi Liblingsschauspiller ass de Leonardo DiCaprio, well hie super an all Aart vu Filmer ass.
@en Yes, my favorite actor is Leonardo DiCaprio, because he is great in all kinds of movies.
@distractor-lu Regisseur
@distractor-lu Musical
@distractor-en director
@distractor-en musical

@sentence
@question Leeft de Moment e Film am Kino, deen Dir gesi wëllt?
@lu Jo, de Moment leeft en Documentaire iwwer d'Natur, deen ech gesi wëll.
@en Yes, currently there is a documentary about nature that I want to see.
@distractor-lu Comedie
@distractor-lu Reklamm
@distractor-en comedy
@distractor-en advertisement

@sentence
@question Mat wiem gitt Dir normalerweis an de Kino?
@lu Ech ginn normalerweis mat menge Frënn an de Kino.
@en I usually go to the cinema with my friends.
@distractor-lu eleng
@distractor-lu Regisseur
@distractor-en alone
@distractor-en director

@sentence
@question Eleng an de Kino goen: Wat haalt Dir dovun?
@lu Ech fannen et okay, eleng an de Kino ze goen, well ech net ëmmer Gesellschaft brauch.
@en I find it okay to go to the cinema alone, because I do not always need company.
@distractor-lu Frënn
@distractor-lu langweileg
@distractor-en friends
@distractor-en boring

@sentence
@question Wat mécht e Film interessant fir Iech?
@lu E Film ass fir mech interessant, wann d'Handlung spannend bleift.
@en A movie is interesting for me when the plot stays exciting.
@distractor-lu langweileg
@distractor-lu Reklamm
@distractor-en boring
@distractor-en advertisement

@sentence
@question A wéi enger Sprooch kuckt Dir Filmer?
@lu Ech kucke Filmer meeschtens op Englesch, well dat eng international Sprooch ass.
@en I watch movies mostly in English, because that is an international language.
@distractor-lu Lëtzebuergesch
@distractor-lu Ënnertitelen
@distractor-en Luxembourgish
@distractor-en subtitles

@sentence
@question Wéi oft kaaft Dir Filmer op DVD?
@lu Ech kafe bal ni DVDen, well ech éischter um Internet streamen.
@en I almost never buy DVDs, because I rather stream on the internet.
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-lu Serien
@distractor-en cinema
@distractor-en series

@sentence
@question Kuckt Dir och Filmer um Internet? Wat sinn d'Virdeeler?
@lu Jo, dat ass ganz bequeem, well ech selwer wiele kann, wat ech kucke wëll.
@en Yes, that is very convenient, because I can choose myself what I want to watch.
@distractor-lu deier
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en expensive
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@question Wat denkt Dir iwwer Bicher, déi verfilmt ginn?
@lu Dat hänkt dovun of, wéi et gemaach ass, mee heiansdo weist de Film seng eege Vue op d'Buch.
@en That depends on how it is done, but sometimes the movie shows its own view of the book.
@distractor-lu Handlung
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en plot
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir eng Tëlee doheem, an och am Schlofzëmmer?
@lu Mir hunn eng Tëlee doheem, mee am Schlofzëmmer hu mir keng, an dat fannen ech gutt esou.
@en We have a TV at home, but in the bedroom we have none, and I find that good.
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-lu Internet
@distractor-en cinema
@distractor-en internet

@sentence
@question Kuckt Dir vill Tëlee, a wéi vill an der Moyenne pro Woch?
@lu Ech kucken net esou vill, an der Moyenne ongeféier fënnef Stonnen an der Woch.
@en I do not watch that much, on average about five hours a week.
@distractor-lu Dag
@distractor-lu Reklammen
@distractor-en day
@distractor-en advertisements

@sentence
@question Wat kuckt Dir gär op der Tëlee?
@lu Ech kucke gär Comedien a Filmer iwwer Reesen.
@en I like watching comedies and movies about traveling.
@distractor-lu Krimi
@distractor-lu Noriichten
@distractor-en thriller
@distractor-en news

@sentence
@question Wat fir Sendunge kuckt Dir nach?
@lu Ech kucken d'Noriichten an och Kachsendungen, well se mech ëmmer inspiréieren.
@en I watch the news and also cooking shows, because they always inspire me.
@distractor-lu Reklammen
@distractor-lu Musical
@distractor-en advertisements
@distractor-en musical

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir Filmer oder Serië léiwer?
@lu Ech hu Serië léiwer, well se d'Geschicht besser erziele kënnen.
@en I like series better, because they can tell the story better.
@distractor-lu Filmer
@distractor-lu Comedien
@distractor-en movies
@distractor-en comedies

@sentence
@question Wéi ee Programm kuckt Dir ni op der Tëlee?
@lu Reality-Showe kucken ech ni, well se mech guer net interesséieren.
@en I never watch reality shows, because they do not interest me at all.
@distractor-lu dacks
@distractor-lu spannend
@distractor-en often
@distractor-en exciting

@sentence
@question Benotzt Dir och Streaming-Plattformen?
@lu Jo, ech benotzen Amazon Prime, Netflix an Apple TV.
@en Yes, I use Amazon Prime, Netflix and Apple TV.
@distractor-lu DVDen
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en DVDs
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@question Wéini hutt Dir fir d'lescht eng klassesch Tëlee gekuckt?
@lu Dat war viru Joren, well haut bei mir alles iwwer den Internet leeft.
@en That was years ago, because today everything at my place runs over the internet.
@distractor-lu Owend
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en evening
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@question A wéi enger Sprooch kuckt Dir d'Noriichten?
@lu Meeschtens kucken ech d'Noriichten op Englesch, mee elo probéieren ech se och op Lëtzebuergesch ze liesen.
@en Mostly I watch the news in English, but now I also try to read them in Luxembourgish.
@distractor-lu Filmer
@distractor-lu Ënnertitelen
@distractor-en movies
@distractor-en subtitles

@sentence
@question Wat maacht Dir, wa Reklammen op der Tëlee kommen?
@lu Wann ze vill Reklamme kommen, wiesselen ech de Kanal oder maachen eng Paus.
@en When too many advertisements come, I switch the channel or take a break.
@distractor-lu Film
@distractor-lu Noriichten
@distractor-en movie
@distractor-en news

@sentence
@question Ass d'Tëlee wichteg fir Iech?
@lu Nee, d'Tëlee ass net esou wichteg fir mech, mee ech kucken dacks thematesch Videoen op YouTube.
@en No, the TV is not that important to me, but I often watch thematic videos on YouTube.
@distractor-lu Noriichten
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en news
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@question Wat maacht Dir léiwer: Tëlee kucken oder liesen? Firwat?
@lu Ech liese léiwer, well ech a mengem eegenen Tempo liesen an en Abschnitt nach eng Kéier liese kann.
@en I prefer reading, because I read at my own pace and can read a paragraph one more time.
@distractor-lu Filmer
@distractor-lu Tëlee
@distractor-en movies
@distractor-en television

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir als Kand méi oder manner Tëlee gekuckt?
@lu Ongeféier d'selwecht, mee haut kucken ech YouTube a wielen, wat mech wierklech interesséiert.
@en About the same, but today I watch YouTube and choose what really interests me.
@distractor-lu Radio
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en radio
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@question Kucken d'Kanner hautdesdaags ze vill Tëlee?
@lu D'Kanner kucken haut net vill Tëlee, mee si kucken TikTok, an dat ass schlecht fir de Kapp.
@en Children today do not watch much TV, but they watch TikTok, and that is bad for the head.
@distractor-lu Filmer
@distractor-lu gutt
@distractor-en movies
@distractor-en good

@sentence
@question Tëlee kucke mécht domm: Wat mengt Dir?
@lu Ech mengen, et hänkt dovun of, wat ee kuckt, an eng gutt Sendung mécht net domm.
@en I think it depends on what you watch, and a good broadcast does not make you dumb.
@distractor-lu Reklamm
@distractor-lu langweileg
@distractor-en advertisement
@distractor-en boring

